OL,3,GNEWSAWatch live as Lib Dem leader Ed
OL,4,ADavey faces questions from BBC local
OL,5,Aradio
OL,6,
OL,7,FLiberal Democrat leader Ed Davey is
OL,8,Ftaking part in a series of quick-fire
OL,9,Finterviews on BBC local radio stations
OL,10,F- watch live at the top of this page
OL,12,FHis party is preparing to host its
OL,13,Fautumn conference, which takes place in
OL,14,FBrighton from Saturday
OL,16,FThe BBC "local radio round" has been a
OL,17,Fpre-conference tradition for many
OL,18,Fyears. Leaders of the Conservatives,
OL,19,FGreens, Labour and Reform UK have all
OL,20,Fbeen given a similar opportunity -
OL,21,FReform's Richard Tice was first up
OL,22,Fearlier this month
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
